# Fab Asset Reference — Violet's Revenge
**Engine:** Unity | **Pipeline:** URP (confirm before purchasing HDRP-only assets)

---

## Strategy

Assets are sourced in dependency order. The **environment sets the visual grammar** — all other categories (texture, sound, VFX, animation) are chosen to match it. Do not purchase downstream categories before locking the environment.

---

