## 5. VFX — Psychic Overlay (Violet's Ability)

Violet's synesthesia reads lies and past events as **spatial misalignment** — objects and spaces feel physically wrong. VFX must feel like the world subtly breaking, not supernatural magic. Layer these three together.

### Layer 1 — Core Psychic Read (Point Distortion)
**Distortion Effects**
**URL:** https://www.fab.com/listings/d55eaa36-1180-43d9-b052-588da4ce55e8

Noise and distortion shaders with circle distortion (field around a point), flow distortion, and multi-texture chaos. Works on both mesh and skinned mesh. Use to signal a lie or misalignment registering in the space around a specific object or person.

### Layer 2 — POV Shift (Screen-Level Activation)
**Retro Shaders Pro for Unity URP**
**URL:** https://www.fab.com/listings/bc67f4f6-ea3b-4f6a-9693-aab0e7a4114f
⚠️ **URP only** — confirm pipeline before purchasing.

Chromatic aberration, scanlines, RGB subpixel rendering. Apply selectively when Violet's ability activates to make the whole screen feel slightly wrong. Fully tested Unity 2022.3 through 6.3, supports Render Graph.

### Layer 3 — Environmental Wrongness (Residue Signal)
**Gravity Swarm Distortion Effect**
**URL:** https://www.fab.com/listings/5508a186-79ab-43de-ba4a-709aaf01d133

Texture-based moving distortion + Niagara particle distortion waves + swarm-behavior particles. Use to tag specific locations where psychic residue exists — a subtle ripple/swarm indicating something happened here without spelling it out.

