## 6. Animation — Violet (Player Character)

### Locomotion & Stealth
**Female Locomotion Animation Pack**
**URL:** https://www.fab.com/listings/02a01085-878e-41af-8889-610eed0916b3

75 mocap animations: walk, stealth crouch, jog, roll, duck, slide. All with left/right variants for clean blending. The stealth/crouch set covers Violet's methodical movement through crime scenes. Humanoid rig, Unity-compatible.

### Confrontation
**Silent Takedown Animation Pack**
**URL:** https://www.fab.com/listings/a882f9ec-ee79-4acb-8fda-320edb319f67

56 animations: 23 unique silent takedowns + matching reaction animations. Designed for stealth, horror, and adventure. Unity-compatible. Keeps Violet's confrontations surgical rather than combat-heavy.

### Idle Personality
**Idle Animations Pack #03**
**URL:** https://www.fab.com/listings/e5056dfd-0206-45c3-91e4-765736123b68

20 Vicon optical mocap idles: anxious fidgeting, nervous surveillance-checking, tired postures, leaning stances. Gives Violet living, observational idle behavior consistent with her hyper-aware psychic-synesthesia personality.

