## 7. Animation — The Guilty (NPCs / Enemies)

The Guilty are **human antagonists**, not monsters. They need believable institutional/civilian movement — the contrast with Violet's precision is itself atmospheric.

### Base NPC Movement
**MC Core Motion Animation Pack**
**URL:** https://www.fab.com/listings/9657e6b9-a480-43a8-a0f0-55abd806ce85

659 mocap animations across 30+ sets, male and female. Covers all foundational humanoid movement: walk, jog, crouch, pick up, turn, idle. Animations share matching entry/exit poses for seamless blending. Right base for the Clerk, the Undertaker, the Witness, and the Coroner as ordinary-looking people moving through ordinary spaces.

