## Pipeline Note

Before purchasing, confirm whether the project is running **URP or HDRP**. Several assets above — particularly in the VFX layer — are pipeline-specific. The Retro Shaders Pro (Layer 2, psychic POV) is URP-only and will need a swap if the project moves to HDRP.

